Author:     Henry Cikanek <cikanekhenry@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2025-10-27
Commit:     GitHub <noreply@github.com>
CommitDate: 2025-10-28

    fix(smart-calendar): Fix auto-sched event approval and rejection flow
    
    Fixed critical issues in the proposed event lifecycle preventing proper
    approval/rejection of auto-scheduled events:
    
    - Fixed rejectProposedEventController validation to check isAutoScheduled
      instead of incorrect source field check
    - Fixed reject service call to pass full req object (was missing user data,
      causing "Cannot read properties of undefined" error)
    - Prevented premature Google Calendar sync by adding isConfirmed: false to
      auto-scheduled events in taskEventSchedulerService
    - Fixed field mismatch in googleCalenderPushSyncService (description vs
      eventDetails)
    - Enhanced confirmAndSyncProposedEvent with validation for auto-scheduled
      and unconfirmed events
    - Added approveProposedEvent

