AuthorDate: 2025-10-10
Commit:     GitHub <noreply@github.com>
CommitDate: 2025-10-10

    fix(middleware): Prevent server crash in file upload [EVO-2097] (#438)
    
    Replace throw statements with next(error) in mediaAssetUpload middleware to prevent uncaught exceptions that crash the Node.js server.
    
    Changes:
    - Fixed fileFilter callback to pass AppError object instead of string
    - Replaced throw with next(error) in upload callback handler
    - Removed unused catchAsync import
    
    This prevents 502 errors in production when file validation fails.
    
    Co-authored-by: Umesh Shrestha <stha.ums@gmail.com>

