    feat(ci): Add semantic release and tag-based deployment [EVO-456]
    
    Add complete CI/CD pipeline with automated versioning:
    - semantic-release configuration for dev/stage/prod environments
    - validate-commits workflow with conventional commit validation
    - release workflow triggered on successful validation
    - deploy workflow updated to use tags instead of branches
    - tag-based environment detection (dev: v*-dev.*, stage: v*-rc.*, prod: v*)
    - automated changelog generation and GitHub releases
    
    Pipeline flow: validate-commits → release → deploy

