Author:     Henry Cikanek <cikanek@usc.edu>
AuthorDate: 2025-04-28
Commit:     Henry Cikanek <cikanek@usc.edu>
CommitDate: 2025-04-28

    Refactored Express AI proxy to improve modularity and authentication handling
    
    • Introduced services/agent/aiService.js to encapsulate HTTP proxy logic for /chat and /tasks/generate endpoints using Axios.
    • Updated Chat and Task controllers to delegate to the new AI service, decoupling business logic from HTTP handling.
    • Normalized JWT extraction by preserving full Authorization header through Express and forwarding it unchanged to the FastAPI microservice.
    • Added header‐logging middleware to diagnose auth flow and ensure compatibility with existing isLogged guard.

